Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=18}===============================DIALOGUE============================
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.47,0:01:58.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que foi que você disse, Luffy?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.57,0:02:01.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamo domar esse polvão\Ne fazer ele puxar o nosso navio!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.67,0:02:03.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,De jeito nenhum!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.87,0:02:08.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olha bem! Na real, nem precisa olhar bem,\N já que ele é enorme!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.81,0:02:11.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caramba, é grande mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.28,0:02:12.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É o nosso fim!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.18,0:02:15.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele já deve tá por aí faz séculos!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.79,0:02:19.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}O kraken aparece em vários mitos\N pelo mundo todo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.02,0:02:22.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É uma criatura lendária!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:24.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uma criatura sem ossos...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.80,0:02:27.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,e eu, um esqueleto sem carne...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.77,0:02:31.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É como se fosse uma existência\N completamente oposta a minha.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.00,0:02:32.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninguém se importa!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você tem talento.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.94,0:02:38.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bom, não é o tipo de coisa\N que se vê com frequência...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.11,0:02:39.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Desenhando?! Que calma é essa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.84,0:02:43.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tô contigo, mas você tem algum plano, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.68,0:02:46.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O problema é que a gente tá no mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.12,0:02:49.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não. Não. Não.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:52.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O problema é o tamanho dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.76,0:02:54.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Seria perigoso até em terra firme.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.63,0:02:58.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Qual é o problema desse povo?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:04.47,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esse é o tipo de situação em que todos concordam\N em fugir a toda velocidade!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:06.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ajuste o rumo para o sul!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.14,0:03:09.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ô, Nami, é pra ir direto pro polvo!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não seja idiota!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.64,0:03:11.14,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Me escuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquele polvo vai...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.14,0:03:12.94,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Calma, calma, Srta. Nami.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.94,0:03:14.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu estou aqui por...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:16.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,aqui por...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.28,0:03:21.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,por você!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.39,0:03:22.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Conseguiu segurar!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.95,0:03:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bom trabalho!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.09,0:03:27.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Graças à reabilitação\Ne ao fato de a Nami estar usando um casaco.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.99,0:03:31.60,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Ficar nesse navio é um perigo!\NEu tenho que me proteger!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.03,0:03:33.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem algo vindo ali por trás!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.43,0:03:38.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Amado irmão!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.80,0:03:39.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eles voltaram!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:43.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Coribou! Pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.24,0:03:46.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós salvar amado irmão!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.01,0:03:47.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sim!\N– Sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.21,0:03:51.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês voltaram para me salvar, é isso?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.02,0:03:58.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não faz isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.43,0:04:03.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A bolha de revestimento estourou!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:06.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E aquele navio é muito maior que o {\i1}Sunny{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.97,0:04:12.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.44,0:04:21.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tão parecendo água-viva.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.71,0:04:24.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cale a boca, Roronoa! Fica quieto!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.18,0:04:27.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá vindo!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.59,0:04:32.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É grande demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.02,0:04:34.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como vamos enfrentar algo assim?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.23,0:04:36.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Gear Thir...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.03,0:04:38.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nem pensar!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.53,0:04:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês vão estourar a bolha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,175)}Chicken Voyage!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.33,0:04:45.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,175)}{\an8}(Nota: Viagem de Covarde)
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.97,0:04:47.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Será que...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.41,0:04:49.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,dá pra fugir de algum jeito?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.77,0:04:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não façam nada! Eu dou um jeito nele!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.04,0:04:55.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não faz isso! Você vai estourar a bolha!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.65,0:05:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2^}Escutem! Se vocês querem tanto assim\N lutar contra ele, eu tenho uma ideia!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.49,0:05:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.49,0:05:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E qual é? Fala logo.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.89,0:05:07.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ótimo! Assim está perfeito!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.33,0:05:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Esse é o revestimento improvisado para bater perna!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:14.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É um traje de mergulho improvisado!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.73,0:05:20.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Contanto que você fique dentro dele,\N dá até para lutar debaixo d'água!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:25.11,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Se eu deixar esses idiotas fazerem o que quiserem,\N eu também estarei em perigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.11,0:05:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você não devia ter feito isso, estranho!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.41,0:05:29.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A gente queria fugir!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.98,0:05:32.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agora, eles vão lutar!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.08,0:05:38.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu disse para vocês fugirem desde o princípio,\Nmas esse senhor seu capitão não escuta!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:42.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você prefere que eles lutem neste navio?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.99,0:05:44.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certo, boa sorte!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:45.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vão pra bem longe!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.73,0:05:47.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa corda atrapalha demais.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.63,0:05:49.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fiquem longe do navio!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.87,0:05:51.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá bom.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.90,0:05:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beleza, vamo lá!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:54.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Certo!\N– Certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.84,0:05:56.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.77,0:05:58.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esperem!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.48,0:06:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês têm que prender\N as cordas de segurança!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.71,0:06:02.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ou vão acabar se separando!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.91,0:06:05.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A Srta. Nami tá toda preocupadinha comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.15,0:06:07.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Galera!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.72,0:06:09.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chamem a atenção dele pra mim!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.05,0:06:11.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu vou acabar com ele num golpe só!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.36,0:06:15.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu podia dar fim nisso agora mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.23,0:06:17.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não é pra cortar ele!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.69,0:06:19.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu quero pegar aquele polvo pra criar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.03,0:06:23.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eles estão bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.33,0:06:24.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vão pro mais longe que puderem!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.84,0:06:26.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cada milímetro...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.97,0:06:30.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas ele tá atacando {\i1}a gente{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.04,0:06:31.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sai da frente, pessoal!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.38,0:06:35.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Rocket Launcher!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.05,0:06:41.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Lança-Foguetes do Franky)
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.79,0:06:43.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Repeliu o bicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.99,0:06:45.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que potência incrível!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.52,0:06:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Outro tentáculo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.23,0:06:50.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Por que ele só vem atrás de nós?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.90,0:06:54.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Guard Point!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.37,0:06:57.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acertou em cheio!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.24,0:06:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estão todos bem?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.14,0:07:03.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Essa foi por pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.54,0:07:04.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É isso aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.64,0:07:06.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mandou bem, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.25,0:07:11.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos colidir com uma montanha submarina!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Mil Fleurs!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.22,0:07:13.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Mil flores)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gigantesco Mano!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.38,0:07:16.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Mão Gigantesca)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.99,0:07:22.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que mãos enormes!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.96,0:07:25.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– É isso aí!\N– É isso aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.83,0:07:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa é a nossa Robin! Estamos salvos!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.17,0:07:31.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ainda bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.44,0:07:35.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apesar de estar na água, deu tudo certo\N porque foi só por um breve momento.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.74,0:07:38.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Opa, agora é a minha vez!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.05,0:07:43.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gear Third!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Matiz do Armamento: Endurecer!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.74,0:08:12.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O mar tá drenando a minha força!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:18.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Polvo desgraçado!\N Está tentando impedi-lo, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Blue Walk!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.15,0:08:20.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Caminhada Azul)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.08,0:08:24.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê? O Sr. Sanji saiu de sua bolha!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.45,0:08:26.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esquece isso! Olha aquela velocidade!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.69,0:08:28.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele parece um homem-peixe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.13,0:08:29.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que da hora!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.59,0:08:31.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu corri e corri...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.46,0:08:34.30,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,daquelas abominações por dois anos inteiros.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.93,0:08:38.40,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Comparado a eles, este monstro não é nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.40,0:08:40.04,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu diria até que ele é fofo.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.04,0:08:42.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Diable Jambe!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.58,0:08:48.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Bien Cuit...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Grill Shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.41,0:08:51.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Golpe Grelhado Bem Passado)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.52,0:09:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Técnica Secreta do Estilo Três Espadas...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.93,0:09:04.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Encruzilhada dos Seis Caminhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.34,0:09:16.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Epa, epa, Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.94,0:09:19.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não é pra tirar os tentáculos dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.44,0:09:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Gomu Gomu no...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Elephant Gun!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.65,0:09:27.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}{\an8}(Nota: Arma de Caçar Elefantes de Borracha)
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.22,0:09:34.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele apagou o bicho!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.36,0:09:37.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele ficou muito mais forte!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.70,0:09:44.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ué? Tem alguma coisa ali!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.94,0:09:45.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Quê?\N– Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.80,0:09:48.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um tubarão?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.84,0:09:54.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um tubarão?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.85,0:09:57.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquele tubarão tá de roupinha?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.11,0:09:59.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E é dos grandes.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.43,0:10:14.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eles foram levados pela corrente descendente!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.66,0:10:17.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa não! Atrás eles!\NTemos que ficar juntos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.20,0:10:18.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.87,0:10:24.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não quero morrer aqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.41,0:10:26.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês só podem estar brincando!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:27.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E tu ainda tá aqui?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.04,0:10:27.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cês tão calmo demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.65,0:10:31.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Meus olhos estão girando!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.01,0:10:32.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apesar de eu não ter olhos!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.95,0:10:38.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mantenham a verga nivelada!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.82,0:10:42.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tudo a bombordo! Vamos bater\N na plataforma continental!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.09,0:10:44.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entendido!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.63,0:10:47.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mantenha o foco ou o navio vai ser destruído!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.03,0:10:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:51.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cuidado pra não cair pra fora!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.77,0:10:55.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fique no centro da corrente!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.97,0:10:57.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deixa comigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.41,0:11:03.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É muito rápida!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.18,0:11:06.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso aqui tá bom demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.80,0:11:19.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.00,0:11:22.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ai, ai, ai, ai!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.63,0:11:25.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ainda tô vivo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.41,0:11:32.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ué, que foi? Que desânimo todo é esse?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.54,0:11:36.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, já sei! Vocês não conseguem\Nfazer nada sem mim...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que friaca!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.35,0:11:42.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não conseguimos encontrar\N o Luffy e os outros.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acabamos nos separando.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.92,0:11:45.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.52,0:11:49.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Espero que o monstro não tenha\N feito eles em pedaços.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.23,0:11:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sua imaginação é aterrorizante...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.00,0:11:55.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá escuro demais. Eu queria procurar por eles,\N mas não dá pra ver nada!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.47,0:11:58.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu não lido bem com o escuro.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.20,0:12:01.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Eu sinto uma presença. Vocês não?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.20,0:12:04.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nós provavelmente já submergimos\N uns 7 mil metros.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nem o {\i1}Shark Submerge{\i0}\Naguenta a pressão nessa profundidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.21,0:12:08.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}(Nota: Submersível Tubarão)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.18,0:12:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Já estamos chegando\N na Ilha dos Homens-Peixe?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.68,0:12:13.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez eles já tenham chegado lá...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.45,0:12:17.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}A Camie nos disse que a ilha fica a 10 mil metros\N abaixo do nível do mar.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.46,0:12:21.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ainda faltam mais 3 mil metros?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.56,0:12:24.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E eles só tem umas bolhas pequenas.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.49,0:12:27.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mesmo que estejam vivos,\N ficar com tão pouco ar é perigoso!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.26,0:12:30.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Foi por isso que eu disse\Npra usarem a corda de segurança!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.80,0:12:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não vamos resolver nada ficando parados.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.24,0:12:34.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos procurar por eles.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.27,0:12:36.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agora eu tenho um holofote.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.11,0:12:37.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Quê?!\N– Quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.01,0:12:40.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Está no seus olhos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.28,0:12:42.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Franky...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}Nipple Lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.35,0:12:47.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,0)}{\an8}(Nota: Luzes de Mamilo do Franky)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.52,0:12:49.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Botou aí por quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.09,0:12:55.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamo dar no pé!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.93,0:13:04.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.30,0:13:05.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.90,0:13:07.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.67,0:13:10.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Cadê vocês?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:12.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Voltem pra gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.54,0:13:17.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nessa imensidão debaixo d'água,\N os Olhos do Sunny não vão ajudar muito.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.58,0:13:20.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ora, mas que situação...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esta escuridão toda\N está me deixando apreensivo.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.05,0:13:26.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A verdade é que a gente\N não tá chegando a lugar nenhum.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.06,0:13:29.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que a gente faz agora?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.59,0:13:33.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não podemos parar o navio,\Nentão não se distraiam.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.70,0:13:38.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, é uma água-viva!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.90,0:13:40.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem uma água-viva gigante\N  bem acima de nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.87,0:13:42.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que imensa!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.47,0:13:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você tem toda razão!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.51,0:13:46.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E eles estão brilhando!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.64,0:13:49.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tais como estrelas na noite!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.25,0:13:51.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que coisa linda!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.52,0:13:54.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, um tentáculo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.85,0:13:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,S-Será que quer ser minha amiga?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.05,0:13:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não toque nela, Chopper!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.19,0:14:00.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Deve ser peçonhenta!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.20,0:14:07.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa não!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.70,0:14:10.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst de Leve!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.40,0:14:15.64,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Q-Quê?!\N– Q-Quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.64,0:14:17.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A água-viva foi devorada!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.77,0:14:21.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, nós perdemos um pouco de ar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.61,0:14:23.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Melhor do que ser comido!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.51,0:14:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hã?!\N– Hã?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.38,0:14:28.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Coup de Burst é uma arma\Nque atira uma boa quantidade de ar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.38,0:14:33.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas como estamos na água,\N nossa reserva de ar é limitada.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.26,0:14:36.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então, quando atiramos o ar pra fora,\N nossa bolha encolhe!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.50,0:14:43.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O peixe que mordeu ela\N virou de cabeça para baixo!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.57,0:14:45.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então elas são {\i1}mesmo{\i0} peçonhentas.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.17,0:14:46.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Quê?!\N– Quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.04,0:14:48.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O fundo do mar é assustador!\N E escuro também...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.47,0:14:51.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem muitos peixes com olhos brancos...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.61,0:14:54.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aqui é sinistro demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.92,0:15:00.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como o fundo do mar\N está sempre às escuras,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.92,0:15:04.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,há muitas criaturas nele\N com olhos pouco desenvolvidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.42,0:15:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então elas não enxergam bem.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.93,0:15:11.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Otários!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.16,0:15:12.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tão vendo isso? Vem cá!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.20,0:15:15.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas há também aquelas\N com olhos bem desenvolvidos.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:22.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã? Como eu consigo enxergar\N apesar de não ter olhos?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.24,0:15:26.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Todos gostariam de saber o motivo?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.48,0:15:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A resposta é...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.98,0:15:33.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,um segredo!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:37.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Agora deu pra falar sozinho?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.19,0:15:38.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sem problemas.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.56,0:15:41.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu estou acostumado a ficar sozinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.06,0:15:43.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei! Parem com essas bobagens\N e procurem por eles!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.56,0:15:48.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E sobrou para mim por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.30,0:15:52.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!\N– Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.04,0:15:54.77,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Cadê vocês?!\N– Cadê vocês?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.71,0:15:56.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas hein?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.77,0:15:59.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa corda...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.98,0:16:01.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caros amigos.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.21,0:16:02.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:05.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês sabem onde está aquele pirata?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.75,0:16:08.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah é, ele ainda tá por aqui, né?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.08,0:16:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tinha esquecido completamente dele.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.05,0:16:11.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pra onde ele foi?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.55,0:16:14.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não o vejo desde que descemos\N até esta profundidade.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.72,0:16:17.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Talvez tenha sido lançado pra fora\Nquando fomos arrastados pela corrente.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.93,0:16:19.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É bem possível!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.50,0:16:24.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,As mãos e pernas dele estavam amarradas,\Nentão não dava pra ele se segurar em nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.03,0:16:25.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bom, mas...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.24,0:16:26.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Hã?\N– Hã?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.34,0:16:28.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A corda foi desamarrada. Estão vendo?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.74,0:16:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Então, ele tá em algum lugar do navio?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.74,0:16:36.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas onde?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.41,0:16:38.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele deve estar se escondendo\N em algum lugar...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.32,0:16:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.68,0:16:42.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa não...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.89,0:16:48.16,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Posso me esgueirar para o quarto das garotas...\Nse é isso que você quer, docinho.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.16,0:16:49.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Droga!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.86,0:16:53.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}A gente já tá com problema até o pescoço,\Ne agora ainda tem que ficar procurando esse sujeito.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.00,0:16:55.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nem esquenta com isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.23,0:16:57.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele nem é tão forte assim.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.74,0:17:02.01,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Que maravilha!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.97,0:17:09.95,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Aqueles três monstruosos que estavam lutando\Ncontra o kraken desapareceram.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.51,0:17:14.22,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Não tem como eles terem sobrevivido\N depois de se perderem
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.22,0:17:17.12,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,com apenas aquelas bolhas para protegê-los.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.12,0:17:21.46,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,É uma pena que eu não tenha conseguido\N matar o Chapéu de Palha...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.06,0:17:31.13,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}mas ainda posso provar que ele está morto,\N se matar estes seus companheiros e levar suas cabeças.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.24,0:17:36.57,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Mas não posso me afobar.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.57,0:17:38.31,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Sem afobação!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.31,0:17:42.35,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Se eu matá-los agora, não haverá mais ninguém\N para tripular o navio.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.35,0:17:45.85,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,E eles até que levam jeito para conduzi-lo.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.45,0:17:49.42,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,Assim que chegarem\N à Ilha dos Homens-Peixe...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.05,0:17:53.29,Thoughts-207+,,0,0,0,,todos vocês morrerão!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.96,0:17:59.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Achei ele!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.37,0:18:03.43,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa não!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.43,0:18:08.17,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Droga! Que inferno!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.40,0:18:06.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso vai dar um jeito nele.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.17,0:18:08.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Como ele entrou neste barril?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.74,0:18:10.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A gente se descuidou.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.71,0:18:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Se ele não fosse tão imbecil,\N estaríamos encrencados.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.51,0:18:16.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O corpo dele tava derretendo feito lama.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.71,0:18:18.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Feito lama?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.82,0:18:21.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É, tenho certeza que isso é o poder\N de uma Fruta do Diabo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.65,0:18:24.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele deve ter comido uma Logia.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.65,0:18:28.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele se deixou ser capturado de propósito.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.66,0:18:30.16,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.16,0:18:33.63,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Me tire daqui, moço!\NMoço com roupa de banho!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.03,0:18:36.30,Secondary-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu serei seu servo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.30,0:18:41.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hum? Qual o problema, Chopper?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.60,0:18:42.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sei lá.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.97,0:18:45.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ficou quente do nada.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.24,0:18:47.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não aguento calor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.44,0:18:49.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que calor!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.81,0:18:50.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que aconteceu?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.15,0:18:53.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-O que é isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.88,0:18:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fumaça?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.02,0:18:56.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá bloqueando nossa visão frontal!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.12,0:19:01.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fumaça no fundo do mar? Mas por quê?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.46,0:19:02.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.66,0:19:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Só pode ser...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.57,0:19:12.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Depósitos hidrotermais!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.07,0:19:13.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hã?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.07,0:19:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uma região vulcânica submarina!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.57,0:19:16.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O quê?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.71,0:19:18.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olhem, resquícios de erupções vulcânicas!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.98,0:19:21.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos dar o fora daqui!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.98,0:19:24.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Se acontecer uma erupção, ferrou pra gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.81,0:19:27.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá quente... Muito quente...!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.69,0:19:32.29,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tem alguma coisa atrás de nós!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.29,0:19:34.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Poliquetas carnívoras!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.66,0:19:35.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não temos escolha.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.89,0:19:38.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst de Leve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.86,0:19:44.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Caranguejos sem rosto!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.33,0:19:46.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst de Leve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.04,0:19:50.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu nem sei o que é isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.11,0:19:53.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fad(150,150)}Coup de Burst de Leve!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.14,0:19:55.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O fundo do mar é assustador demais!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.18,0:20:00.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não tem como o Luffy e os outros\N sobreviverem aqui.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.22,0:20:02.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Já tô começando a ficar triste.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.05,0:20:04.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fazia tanto tempo que a gente não se via...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.15,0:20:07.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Para de besteira!\N Eles não vão morrer fácil assim!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.56,0:20:12.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Fui usando o Coup de Burst aos pouquinhos,\Nmas mesmo assim perdemos muito ar.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.40,0:20:17.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que é aquilo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.73,0:20:19.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É tão brilhante!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.47,0:20:22.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aquilo é a Ilha dos Homens-Peixe?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.47,0:20:24.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acham que o Luffy e os outros já estão lá?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.71,0:20:27.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ainda não submergimos\N os 3 mil metros restantes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.41,0:20:30.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnFOT-KafuTechno Std E Strp\b1}Quem são vocês?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.48,0:20:31.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.41,0:20:33.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,De onde você tá mandando\N esses sinais luminosos?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.38,0:20:35.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tão vendo alguma coisa?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.52,0:20:37.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não, ainda está brilhante demais.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.06,0:20:42.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ferrou!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.23,0:20:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É um tamboril! Ele enganou a gente!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.43,0:20:51.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fomos enganados\N pelo caçador das profundezas!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.87,0:20:56.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Essa foi por pouco!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.44,0:20:58.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Estamos totalmente encurralados!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.88,0:21:00.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Será que ainda dá pra escapar...?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.75,0:21:08.55,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que foi dessa vez?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.55,0:21:09.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,A-Aquilo é uma pessoa?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.99,0:21:11.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Que raios é aquilo?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.92,0:21:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um monstro no mar\N que se parece com um homem...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.33,0:21:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É um monge do mar!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.63,0:21:27.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele vai emborcar o navio!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.81,0:21:31.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E foi nele?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.04,0:21:34.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aí, Ankoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.14,0:21:35.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você não pode fazer isso!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.65,0:21:38.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não é pra comer navios!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.08,0:21:41.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Quantas vezes eu tenho que te dizer?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.98,0:21:45.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Capitão Vander Decken\N não vai gostar nada disso!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.96,0:21:48.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,E-Ele nos salvou?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.29,0:21:51.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vamos logo! Já tava mesmo na hora\N da gente meter o pé!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.66,0:21:53.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele também é um monstro!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.81,0:22:04.14,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Aquilo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.91,0:22:05.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}sou eu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.80,0:22:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Os mortos não falam, nem têm desejo...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.17,0:22:10.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}naquele lugar sombrio\N onde nem os corvos ousam voar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.68,0:22:16.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Os mortos não precisam de joias em seus dedos,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.19,0:22:21.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}nem seu pesar na escuridão se pode enxergar.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.92,0:22:23.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Procurem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.93,0:22:25.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Procurem!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.93,0:22:30.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Os tesouros afundados são meus por direito!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.40,0:22:33.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}Eu sou o homem mais rico do mundo inteiro...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.87,0:22:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\fnBlackadder ITC\fscx125\fscy125\bord3.25\shad3.25\fad(150,150)}o Capitão Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.61,0:22:43.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não pode ser!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.05,0:22:48.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Até no fundo do mar?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.59,0:22:57.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Um navio fantasma?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.43,0:22:59.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você é quem menos devia se assustar!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.46,0:23:02.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu dei uma giradinha! À toa mesmo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.33,0:23:06.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naquela época, a gente realmente achava\Nque você era um fantasma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.40,0:23:08.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,P-Porém aquele ali é de verdade!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.70,0:23:10.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Olhem para aquela vela!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.17,0:23:14.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É o infame {\i1}Holandês Voador{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.51,0:23:17.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}Este é um navio que nem deveria existir neste mundo!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.88,0:23:21.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aconteceu há centenas de anos.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.19,0:23:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Em um dia de tempestade...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.76,0:23:28.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,o capitão de um navio pirata\N enlouqueceu repentinamente
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.92,0:23:34.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}e assassinou toda a sua tripulação,\Njogando-os nas águas turbulentas, um após o outro.{Z - naturalness}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.16,0:23:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ele amaldiçoou até mesmo os deuses!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.87,0:23:40.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O nome deste capitão era Vander Decken...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:42.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,e o seu navio era o {\i1}Holandês Voador{\i0}!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.54,0:23:45.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Os deuses enfureceram-se com ele...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.47,0:23:52.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,e, como punição, condenaram-no\N a vagar eternamente pelos mares!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:52.48,0:23:59.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{\q2}E agora, o navio bem diante de nós não é outro senão\N a nau assombrada do Capitão Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.29,0:24:02.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ankoro! Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.73,0:24:05.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não poderemos saquear os tesouros\N se o navio for devorado...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.53,0:24:07.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,então destruam-no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.10,0:24:10.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pode deixar!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.73,0:24:13.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O monge do mar tá...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.34,0:24:15.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então ele é {\i1}mesmo{\i0} nosso inimigo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.57,0:24:16.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Franky!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.57,0:24:17.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usa o Coup de Burst!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.91,0:24:20.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não dá! O combustível acabou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.61,0:24:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu tenho que reabastaecer o refri\N na sala de máquinas!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.42,0:24:28.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não dá tempo!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.35,0:24:30.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ferrou!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.75,0:24:31.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,É o nosso fim!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.63,0:24:47.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O Kraken!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.38,0:24:55.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kraken, o Monstro do Ártico?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.22,0:25:08.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tá bom, já chega. Parou aí!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.90,0:25:15.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Mandou bem!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.07,0:25:20.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.97,0:25:23.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Zoro! Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.84,0:25:26.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tô tão feliz de ver vocês vivos!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.61,0:25:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Onde que vocês estavam?!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.51,0:25:32.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Srta. Nami! Robinzita!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.35,0:25:33.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Passamos um tempão atrás de vocês!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.79,0:25:37.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Esses caras dão tanto trabalho.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.35,0:25:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acabaram se perdendo!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.36,0:25:41.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ei!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.66,0:25:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Acorde, Wadatsumi!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:43.63,0:25:46.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Revide! Levante-se!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.00,0:25:54.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aí a minha bolha e a do Sanji estouraram,\Nentão a gente entrou na do Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:55.91,0:25:57.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Até achei que fosse bater as botas!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.41,0:25:59.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Parem de ficar dando preocupação!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.44,0:26:01.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então, eis aqui uma canção\N para celebrar seu retorno.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.11,0:26:06.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Qaunto espaço! Lar doce lar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.02,0:26:08.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy! Eu fiquei tão preocupado!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.42,0:26:13.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Vocês são mesmo bem difíceis de matar.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.19,0:26:14.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eu nem consigo acreditar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:18.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Você realmente domou\N aquele polvo monstruoso?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.43,0:26:21.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Então você vai realmente utilizar-se do kraken?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.93,0:26:26.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso! Eu vou usar ele\Nque nem os profissas fazem!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.67,0:26:27.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Num é, Surume?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:27.67,0:26:30.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é nome de petisco de lula!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.41,0:26:32.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.41,0:26:37.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Apesar do kraken ser um polvo,\N de Surume agora ele é chamado, oh yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.71,0:26:40.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Beleza! Pode puxar o {\i1}Sunny{\i0}, Surume!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.52,0:26:44.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Em vez de só pedir pra ele puxar o navio,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.05,0:26:48.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,é bom ter certeza que ele não vai\N é esmagar ele inteiro.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:48.09,0:26:50.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Capitão, o navio pirata está...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.36,0:26:53.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Não deixem que escapem! Atrás dele!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.20,0:26:55.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– Sim!\N– Sim!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.40,0:27:00.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O que foi isso?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:06.01,0:27:10.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso não é nada bom, Capitão Vander Decken!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:13.22,0:27:14.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Isso é péssimo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.22,0:27:16.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O vulcão submarino vai entrar em erupção!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.29,0:27:19.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,– O quê?!\N– O quê?!
Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{=19}===============================DIALOGUE============================
